{"4073490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Danger Sticks", "steam_appid": 4073490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/efbe45c5607ecba6ebdd6f5bf22498a5.poster.avif?t=1779509574\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/efbe45c5607ecba6ebdd6f5bf22498a5.webm?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/efbe45c5607ecba6ebdd6f5bf22498a5.mp4?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Danger Sticks</strong> is a ruthless, hyper-fast first-person stickman shooter that channels the energy of 2000s flash-era fight animations. You’re a nimble silhouette tearing through blocky, prototype-style recreations of real-world locations. Activate <strong>Nostalgia</strong> to trigger true bullet time, line up crisp headshots, and route through fire with a wide arsenal. Short, handcrafted encounters, instant restarts, and tight scoring create a learn-die-perfect loop built for mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a compact combat puzzle. Read the space at a glance, prioritize targets, and commit. Pop Nostalgia to slow the storm for a heartbeat then thread shots, swap weapons, reposition and then let the world snap back and finish the room before your window closes. Speed, accuracy, and clean movement are everything; hesitation isn’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/e1a334b33687c6f6e0d51b2b0788468c.avif?t=1779509574\" width=1200 height=191 /></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/9c406cd9890851e2aeaa87da358216c5.poster.avif?t=1779509574\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/9c406cd9890851e2aeaa87da358216c5.webm?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/9c406cd9890851e2aeaa87da358216c5.mp4?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True bullet time on demand:</strong> Use Nostalgia to slow the world and sculpt precise, multi-target headshot chains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person, room-clearing combat:</strong> Hand-tuned arenas inspired by real places, presented with a clean, block-out “prototype” vibe for instant readability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wide, punchy arsenal:</strong> Pistols, SMGs, shotguns, rifles, and more. Quick swapping and smart ammo use reward planning under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant restarts:</strong> Fail fast, reset faster, and chase a cleaner line without downtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight scoring for mastery:</strong> Ranks that emphasize speed, accuracy, headshot ratio, and efficient routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature stickman style:</strong> Minimal silhouettes, exaggerated impacts, bold VFX, and crunchy audiovisual feedback that sells every hit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan. Pop Nostalgia. Pounce.</strong> Then do it cleaner, faster, sharper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/fc85b8c0258fc6edf2d8756fa328b2bc.poster.avif?t=1779509574\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/fc85b8c0258fc6edf2d8756fa328b2bc.webm?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/fc85b8c0258fc6edf2d8756fa328b2bc.mp4?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plz wishlist. thx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/efbe45c5607ecba6ebdd6f5bf22498a5.poster.avif?t=1779509574\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/efbe45c5607ecba6ebdd6f5bf22498a5.webm?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/efbe45c5607ecba6ebdd6f5bf22498a5.mp4?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Danger Sticks</strong> is a ruthless, hyper-fast first-person stickman shooter that channels the energy of 2000s flash-era fight animations. You’re a nimble silhouette tearing through blocky, prototype-style recreations of real-world locations. Activate <strong>Nostalgia</strong> to trigger true bullet time, line up crisp headshots, and route through fire with a wide arsenal. Short, handcrafted encounters, instant restarts, and tight scoring create a learn-die-perfect loop built for mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a compact combat puzzle. Read the space at a glance, prioritize targets, and commit. Pop Nostalgia to slow the storm for a heartbeat then thread shots, swap weapo