rong>Signature stickman style:</strong> Minimal silhouettes, exaggerated impacts, bold VFX, and crunchy audiovisual feedback that sells every hit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan. Pop Nostalgia. Pounce.</strong> Then do it cleaner, faster, sharper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/fc85b8c0258fc6edf2d8756fa328b2bc.poster.avif?t=1779509574\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/fc85b8c0258fc6edf2d8756fa328b2bc.webm?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/extras/fc85b8c0258fc6edf2d8756fa328b2bc.mp4?t=1779509574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plz wishlist. thx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A ruthless, hyper-fast, first-person stickman shooter that channels flash era stick-fight energy. Use Nostalgia to slow time, chain crisp headshots, and flow through dense arenas with a wide arsenal. Instant restarts and tight scoring reward speed, accuracy, and perfect movement.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Greek, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Croatian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/97467fa07873048f8f8c512336dc9ff62fa3a44d/header.jpg?t=1779509574", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073490/242d20f6d471dca44574b246b032e3fb7e2a08ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=177950957